"""
Episode 124: Debezium CDC Pipeline
Mumbai Database Change Tracking Style

Bhai, jaise Mumbai mein har ghar ka water meter reading track karte hai,
waise hi ye Debezium har database change ko track karta hai real-time.
Change Data Capture ka asli power dekho!

Author: Hindi Podcast Team
Cost: ₹3,000-8,000/month for CDC infrastructure
Latency: <100ms for change detection
"""

import json
import time
